title: The buttons that open and close each side, clicks on the rail icons, and an icon moved to the top of its bar
expect-file: {WORK}\data\session.json :: "left": \[\s*"deps",\s*"files"
folders: git-changes
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left none
right none
wait 500
mark a-closed
wait 500
ui click 1684 872
wait 700
mark b-right-button-nothing-on-the-right
wait 500
ui click 22 872
wait 700
mark c-left-button
wait 500
ui click 22 872
wait 600
right symbols
wait 500
ui click 22 872
wait 500
ui click 22 872
wait 700
mark d-left-button-reopens-symbols
wait 500
ui click 22 129
wait 800
mark e-click-changes-icon
wait 500
ui click 22 129
wait 600
mark f-click-it-again-closes
wait 500
move deps left files
wait 800
mark g-deps-first-on-the-bar
wait 500
right deps
wait 700
mark h-deps-open-its-icon-is-the-tab
wait 500
move deps right
wait 800
mark i-deps-on-the-right-bar
wait 500
left files
wait 600
mark j-files
wait 500
quit
